Installing maven on amazon linux (manually):

To get the latest version of maven follow the below steps 
go to https://dlcdn.apache.org
select maven
next select your required version ex:maven3
here select appropriate version you need ex : 3.9.16
then go to /binaries folder 
here we have this link copy the link ex: https://dlcdn.apache.org/maven/maven-3/3.9.16/binaries/apache-maven-3.9.16-bin.tar.gz
nxt go to you instance run the below steps it will install maven on your instance


wget https://dlcdn.apache.org/maven/maven-3/3.9.16/binaries/apache-maven-3.9.16-bin.tar.gz
tar -zxvf apache-maven-3.9.16-bin.tar.gz
mv apache-maven-3.9.16 maven
cd maven/
cd bin/
export M2_HOME=/opt/maven
export PATH=$M2_HOME/bin:$PATH
mvn -v
